{%- comment -%}
  FLINT - SELF-HOSTED FONTS (section 14)

  Replaces the render-blocking Google Fonts request. Removes a DNS lookup, a
  TLS handshake and a blocking stylesheet from the critical path.

  Seven static woff2 files in assets/, one per weight:

    newsreader-200.woff2          ExtraLight  - hero headline
    newsreader-300.woff2          Light       - h1, h2, ledes
    newsreader-400.woff2          Regular     - h3, h4, card titles
    newsreader-400-italic.woff2   Italic      - blockquotes
    inter-400.woff2               Regular     - body
    inter-500.woff2               Medium      - nav, buttons
    inter-600.woff2               SemiBold    - labels

  Google Webfonts Helper serves static weights, not variable fonts, so these
  are individual font-face rules rather than weight ranges. See FONTS.md.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Only two preloads. Each competes with the hero image for bandwidth, so
  preload the weights certain to appear above the fold and let the rest
  arrive normally.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin
      href="{{ 'newsreader-300.woff2' | asset_url }}">
<link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin
      href="{{ 'inter-400.woff2' | asset_url }}">

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Newsreader';
    src: url('{{ 'newsreader-200.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 200; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Newsreader';
    src: url('{{ 'newsreader-300.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 300; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Newsreader';
    src: url('{{ 'newsreader-400.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Newsreader';
    src: url('{{ 'newsreader-400-italic.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 300 400; font-style: italic; font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter';
    src: url('{{ 'inter-400.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter';
    src: url('{{ 'inter-500.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter';
    src: url('{{ 'inter-600.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
  }
</style>
